  "label": "Hitler is mapped as the one who 'did nazi that bird fly by'",
  "description": "The text 'i did nazi that bird fly by' is overlaid on the image of Adolf Hitler, creating an analogical mapping where Hitler is implicitly identified as the agent performing the action described in the text. The text humorously attributes to Hitler the mundane act of a bird flying by, using the word 'nazi' as a sarcastic or absurd modifier. This mapping is central to the meme's shock humor and its hateful intent, as it trivializes Hitler's historical role by associating him with a trivial event. The visual entity (Adolf_Hitler) is mapped onto the textual entity (text_chunk) to create this incongruous and offensive association.",
